--Description: Combine (a) counties whose unemployment counts rose from 2015→2018 (via
--`unemployed_pop`) with (b) counties whose dual-eligible enrollee totals fell from
--2015-12-01→2018-12-01.  Because the ACS table lacks an explicit county-name field,
